MedSynth dataset
----------------
The training and evaluation data is derived from MedSynth: A. Rezaie Mianroodi et al.,
"MedSynth: Realistic, Synthetic Medical Dialogue-Note Pairs" (arXiv:2508.01401),
https://huggingface.co/datasets/Ahmad0067/MedSynth (code: https://github.com/ahmadrezarm/MedSynth).
The dataset card states no license, so this repository's license grants no rights to
the data, and files derived from it are included only to reproduce the experiments here.
The dataset's card says it is not a source of reliable medical information and is
intended for improving dialogue-to-note models; this project treats it the same way.
To regenerate the data files from the source: dataset/dataset_gen.py, then
dataset/prep_and_validate.py, dataset/inject_noise.py and dataset/split_dataset.py
(the split is seeded).

ICD-10-CM code list
-------------------
gateway/data/icd10cm_fy2026.tsv.gz is built from the FY2026 ICD-10-CM order file
published by the U.S. Centers for Disease Control and Prevention, National Center
for Health Statistics (https://ftp.cdc.gov/pub/Health_Statistics/NCHS/Publications/ICD10CM/2026/).

